WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Start the local mesh fixture and admin endpoint.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
narrator: This tape demonstrates minting; it does not redeem the new keys.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:11.000
narrator: Local minting creates a key outside the running daemon's store.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:26.000
narrator: Remote minting sends a request to the running daemon.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:40.000
narrator: The reusable variant requests a twenty-four-hour lifetime.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:06.000
narrator: Send the equivalent preauthorization request through the admin HTTP API.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.000
narrator: Remove the fixture after inspecting the returned keys.
